<Legal title="Sponsorship Terms" heading="Sponsorship Terms" description="Terms for Swarmnest Featured Listings, Category Sponsors and Sitewide Sponsors: review before going live, full refund if declined, labels, cancellation and what we never sell." path="/sponsorship-terms/">
<p>These terms apply when you buy a Featured Listing, Category Sponsor or Sitewide Sponsor placement on swarmnest.ai ("Sponsorship"). They add to our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Sale and Use</a>, our <a href="/acceptable-use/">Acceptable Use Policy</a> and our <a href="/disclosure/">Sponsored &amp; Affiliate Disclosure</a>. If these terms conflict with the Terms of Sale and Use on a Sponsorship, these terms win.</p>

<h2>1. Every Order Is Reviewed First</h2>
<ul>
<li>Nothing goes live automatically. We review every order, the promoted product and your text before it appears, usually within 2 business days.</li>
<li>We accept products relevant to AI agents and developers. We may decline any order, for example crypto or financial schemes, adult content, malware, misleading claims, or anything that breaks our Acceptable Use Policy.</li>
<li><strong>If we decline your order, we refund it in full.</strong></li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Sponsorship Never Affects Our Listings</h2>
<ul>
<li>Payment never affects whether a tool is listed, where it ranks, its description, its labels, its OS or format tags, or any review status. Organic lists and sorting stay the same.</li>
<li>Sponsors do not review or approve what we write about them or their competitors.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Labels and Links</h2>
<ul>
<li>Every placement is labeled "Sponsored" and shown apart from the regular results.</li>
<li>Sponsored links use <code>rel="sponsored"</code>.</li>
<li><strong>We do not sell Verified badges, SEO links or "dofollow" links</strong>, paid inclusion in the directory, or guaranteed clicks or traffic.</li>
<li>Placements are static: one card per page, never sticky, animated or pop-up. We may adjust layout, wording length or position on the page for design or accessibility.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Billing, Renewal and Cancellation</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Monthly plans</strong> renew automatically each month at the price shown at checkout, until you cancel. <strong>One-time orders</strong> cover 30 days and do not renew.</li>
<li>A placement's period starts when it goes live, not when you pay.</li>
<li><strong>Cancel anytime</strong> in the <a href={BILLING_PORTAL} rel="nofollow">Stripe Billing Portal</a> (enter your checkout email to get a sign-in link), or by emailing <a href="mailto:support@swarmnest.ai">support@swarmnest.ai</a>. The subscription stops at the end of the current paid period and the placement runs until then. There are no partial-month refunds when you cancel.</li>
<li>Charges appear on your statement as <strong>SWARMNEST</strong>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Refunds</h2>
<ul>
<li>Full refund if we decline your order, or if you cancel before your placement goes live.</li>
<li>Pro-rata refund if we remove a placement for a reason that is not your fault.</li>
<li>No refund once a placement is running, except as above, and no refund if we remove it because it breaks these terms or our Acceptable Use Policy.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Your Content</h2>
<ul>
<li>You confirm that you may use the names, text, logos and links you send us, that your claims are true, and that your product follows the law, including the FTC's rules on advertising.</li>
<li>You let us display that content on swarmnest.ai for the placement period. You are responsible for your product and any offer you make.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7. Where We Sell</h2>
<p>As with all Swarmnest purchases, we currently sell Sponsorships only to customers in the United States with a US billing address. We may cancel and refund orders from outside the United States.</p>

<h2>8. Changes</h2>
<p>We may change these terms or our prices for future periods. If a change affects a running monthly plan, we will email you at least 14 days before the next renewal, and you can cancel before it applies.</p>

<p>Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai?subject=Sponsorship">hello@swarmnest.ai</a>. See also <a href="/advertise/">Advertise on Swarmnest</a>.</p>
</Legal>
